      "description": "The BPMN and DMN this layer OWNS: the paper's content processes, grouped by concern exactly as the harness groups its own (`processes/<group>/`, a DMN in `processes/<group>/decisions/`). `content/atomic-mass-drift-check.bpmn`, `content/lean-docs-publish.bpmn` and `content/formalized-publication-authoring.bpmn`. They name Lean and paper skills that live here, which cat-harness cannot reach. Their calls and skill refs that stay generic point DOWN through core to the harness. `authoring-a-paper.bpmn` and its `lean-build-gate.dmn` run on the work plan, so they moved to the opt-in `collab/` sub-graph (owner, 2026-11-13).",
